      "text": "DeMeco Ryans said Texans WR Jaylin Noel (turf toe, walking boot) is still being evaluated to see how significant the injury is. Levitan's route data: Noel ran 15 routes before leaving; Xavier Hutchinson also 15, Kayshon Boutte 13, Marvin Harrison Jr. 8 (2nd game with HOU), Tank Dell 6 (first game since 2024).",
